 pter. Engineers from both firms will share insights into their work\, hi
 ghlighting notable projects\, their approaches to engineering and design
  and their experiences working in the field. Students will learn about e
 ach firm’s areas of expertise\, company culture\, and career paths\, w
 hile also hearing about potential internship and full-time positions. Fo
 llowing the presentations\, students are invited to engage in discussion
 s with the representatives\, ask questions and learn more about the firm
 s and the work they do. Thornton Tomasetti is a global engineering firm 
 with expertise spanning forensics\, renewal\, protective d\nRegister: ht
 tps://princeton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/2049509/overview\nhttps://c
 areerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/thornton-tomasetti-x-guy-nordenson
 -and-associates-x-asce-info-session
