LOCATION:Julis Romo Rabinowitz Building - A01
DESCRIPTION:Learn about the wide range of education careers that alumni h
 ave pursued\, from teaching to policy\, nonprofit work and beyond. You w
 ill learn about careers in education that may be a good fit for you as w
 ell as relevant graduate programs. This program is for students consider
 ing education as a primary focus or interested in exploring career optio
 ns. It is co-sponsored by Princeton Education Society and Princeton Univ
 ersity Center for Career Development\, and is open to all Princeton Univ
 ersity undergraduates regardless of identity.\nRegister: https://app.joi
 nhandshake.com/edu/events/2045564\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.e
